{"headword":"נָתַץ","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb.</strong> pull down, break down <strong>(</strong>NH Hoph., and deriv.; cf. perhaps Ethiopic ነሠተ (with transp. and weakening of sibilant), <em>destruere, demoliri, excidere</em> Di <sup>634</sup><strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:30\" href=\"/Judges.6.30\">Ju 6:30</a> +, 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָֽתְצוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 25:10\" href=\"/II_Kings.25.10\">2 K 25:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 52:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.52.14\">Je 52:14</a>, etc.; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִתֹּץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 26:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.26.9\">Ez 26:9</a> + v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 26:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.26.12\">12</a> (Co, for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">יִתְּצוּ</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּתֹּץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:45\" href=\"/Judges.9.45\">Ju 9:45</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:7\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.7\">2 K 23:7</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִתְּצֵנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 19:10\" href=\"/Job.19.10\">Jb 19:10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יִתָּצְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 52:7\" href=\"/Psalms.52.7\">ψ 52:7</a>; 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶתֹּץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:9\" href=\"/Judges.8.9\">Ju 8:9</a>; 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּתְּצוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 10:27\" href=\"/II_Kings.10.27\">2 K 10:27</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; 2 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּתֹּ֑צוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.5\">Dt 7:5</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּתֹּצ֑וּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:13\" href=\"/Exodus.34.13\">Ex 34:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 2:2\" href=\"/Judges.2.2\">Ju 2:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתִּתְֿצוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.2\">Is 22:2</a>, etc.; Imv. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְתֹץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 58:7\" href=\"/Psalms.58.7\">ψ 58:7</a>; Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לִנְתֿוֹץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 1:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.1.10\">Je 1:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 18:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.18.7\">18:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לִנְתֹֿץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:28\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.28\">31:28</a> (on <span dir=\"rtl\">תֿ</span> v. Ges<sup>§ 45 g</sup>); Pt. pass. pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַנְּתֻצִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 33:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.33.4\">Je 33:4</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"lit. <em>pull down</em> a structure (acc.): altar <a data-ref=\"Judges 2:2\" href=\"/Judges.2.2\">Ju 2:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:30\" href=\"/Judges.6.30\">6:30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:31\" href=\"/Judges.6.31\">31</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:32\" href=\"/Judges.6.32\">32</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:13\" href=\"/Exodus.34.13\">Ex 34:13</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.5\">Dt 7:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:12\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.12\">2 K 23:12</a>; high place <span dir=\"rtl\">(במה)</span> v <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.8\">8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּמָה</span> + <span dir=\"rtl\">מִזְבֵּחַ</span> v <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:15\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.15\">15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַצֵּבָה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 10:27\" href=\"/II_Kings.10.27\">10:27</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית הַבַּעַל</span> v <a data-ref=\"II Kings 10:27\" href=\"/II_Kings.10.27\">27</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 11:18\" href=\"/II_Kings.11.18\">11:18</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 23:17\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.23.17\">2 Ch 23:17</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:7\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.7\">2 K 23:7</a>; a tower <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:9\" href=\"/Judges.8.9\">Ju 8:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:17\" href=\"/Judges.8.17\">17</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 26:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.26.9\">Ez 26:9</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(בְּחַרְבוֹתָיו)</span>; (any) house <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.10\">Is 22:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 26:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.26.12\">Ez 26:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:45\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.45\">Lv 14:45</a>, so <span dir=\"rtl\">הַנְּתֻצִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 33:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.33.4\">Je 33:4</a> (strangely + <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל</span>, cf. Gf Gie); city-wall <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 39:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.39.8\">Je 39:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 25:10\" href=\"/II_Kings.25.10\">2 K 25:10</a> = <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 52:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.52.14\">Je 52:14</a>; city <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:45\" href=\"/Judges.9.45\">Ju 9:45</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"fig.:"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>pull down</em> a nation, break its power, <span dir=\"rtl\">וְלִנְתוֹשׁ וְלִנ׳ וּלְהַאֲבִיד (וְלַהֲרוֹם)</span> (obj. not expressed) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 1:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.1.10\">Je 1:10</a> (so Ecclus 49:7b), = <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 18:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.18.7\">18:7</a>. cf. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:28\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.28\">31:28</a>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"an individual, subj. God, <span dir=\"rtl\">יִתְּצֵנִי סָבִיב</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 19:10\" href=\"/Job.19.10\">Jb 19:10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יִתָּצְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 52:7\" href=\"/Psalms.52.7\">ψ 52:7</a>."}],"num":"b."},{"senses":[{"definition":"jawteeth of lions (metaph.) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 58:7\" href=\"/Psalms.58.7\">ψ 58:7</a> (<em>break down, break off</em>, so only here, but v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, נָתַע\" href=\"/BDB,_נָתַע\", dir=\"rtl\">נָתַע</a>)."}],"num":"c."}],"num":"2."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>be pulled, broken, down:</em> Pf. 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִתְּצוּ מִפְּנֵי י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:26\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.26\">Je 4:26</a> (of cities), so <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ מִמֶּנּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 1:6\" href=\"/Nahum.1.6\">Na 1:6</a> (of rocks)."}],"form":"Niph."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִתַּץ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 33:3\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.33.3\">2 Ch 33:3</a>; 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְנִתְּצוּ</span> <a data-re